## Project Architecture Context (Automait)
**Structure:**
The project is modular, utilizing `src/` for core logic and `.agents/` for persistent state and context.
**Folders & Roles:**
*   `src/`: Contains all core application logic and utilities.
*   `.agents/`: Stores run-time context, history, and internal state management data.
**Key Modules:**
*   `src/cli.js`: CLI entry point. Handles user input and command execution.
*   `src/config.js`: Manages configuration loading (Environment variables > File > Default).
*   `src/git.js`: Abstracts all version control system (VCS) interactions.
*   `src/ollama.js`: Handles structured planning and LLM communication.
*   `src/workflow.js`: Orchestrates the multi-step planning and execution lifecycle.
